 "answer_raw": "A **full shave** is the best option for both looking intentional and achieving the lowest maintenance.\n\nIf you have advanced hair loss (Norwood 6-7), a **buzz cut** or **full shave** looks cleaner than trying to maintain long hair on the sides or sparse strands on top [4]. A full shave is the ultimate hair loss solution and is considered a confident, intentional statement [7].\n\nThe other options break down as follows:\n\n*   **Buzz cut** — A forgiving, low-maintenance option, particularly with #0–#4 stubble [7].\n*   **Keeping the sides** — This can look less intentional; if hair loss is advanced, a shaved head or buzz cut is often the cleaner choice [4].",
 "answer": "A **full shave** is the best option for both looking intentional and achieving the lowest maintenance.\n\nIf you have advanced hair loss (Norwood 6-7), a **buzz cut** or **full shave** looks cleaner than trying to maintain long hair on the sides or sparse strands on top [4]. A full shave is the ultimate hair loss solution and is considered a confident, intentional statement [7].\n\nThe other options break down as follows:\n\n*   **Buzz cut** — A forgiving, low-maintenance option, particularly with #0–#4 stubble [7].\n*   **Keeping the sides** — This can look less intentional; if hair loss is advanced, a shaved head or buzz cut is often the cleaner choice [4].",
